msgid "Auto Receive Samples"
msgstr "自动接收"

msgid "Checked: samples of this client are received automatically when they are registered (the receive step is skipped). Unchecked: samples stay in 'Sample due' and must be received manually, so that the receiving user and time are recorded."
msgstr "勾选后：该委托单位的样品登样提交时自动接收（跳过接收步骤）。不勾选：登样后停在「待接收」，需人工接收，系统会记录接收人与接收时间。"

msgid "Received By"
msgstr "接收人"

msgid "User who received this sample"
msgstr "该样品的接收人"
